 "textLink": null, "company": {"id": "105527223", "name": "HieLite Academy", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/school/hieliteacademy/"}}], "createdAt": "2026-10-26T17:00:19.037Z", "createdAtTimestamp": 1793034019037, "engagement": {"likes": 0, "comments": 0, "shares": 0, "reactions": []}, "postId": "urn:li:ugcPost:7520177214374641664", "pinned": false, "contributed": false, "edited": false, "actor": {"id": "ACoAAEVYn8MBx0E0WQHPWjlbesLqu9DEk7OJhZg", "type": "profile", "name": "Paul Chukwuebuka", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/paul-chukwuebuka-857770285", "position": "Data Analyst | AI Automation Specialist (n8n,Zapier,Make,API,Ai Agent) | Forex Trader", "pictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQEw_vV94WV-vg/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4EaCF8K7GJoAI-/0/1788953539004?e=1795046400&v=beta&t=cyctYl7EckZ_AUj0QtW1Kia5-FEhjkcEiIBxzcVpNFE", "picture": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQEw_vV94WV-vg/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4EaCF8K7GJoAI-/0/1788953539004?e=1795046400&v=beta&t=cyctYl7EckZ_AUj0QtW1Kia5-FEhjkcEiIBxzcVpNFE", "width": 800, "height": 800}, "author": true}}]}, {"id": "7520456457641742336", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7520177214374641664?commentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28ugcPost%3A7520177214374641664%2C7520456457641742336%29&dashCommentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287520456457641742336%2Curn%3Ali%3AugcPost%3A7520177214374641664%29", "commentary": "Checking prices in n8n instead of trusting the browser is the right instinct, and the same rule applies to Paystack: don't mark an order paid from the redirect back to your site. Confirm it from the webhook after checking the x-paystack-signature header (an HMAC SHA512 of the body with your secret key), or call Verify Transaction, and make sure the amount matches the order total. I'd also key it on the payment reference, since the same event can arrive more than once and you don't want one order dispatched twice.", "commentaryAttributes": [], "createdAt": "2026-10-26T12:09:02.827Z", "createdAtTimestamp": 1793016542827, "engagement": {"likes": 2, "comments": 1, "shares": 0, "reactions": [{"type": "LIKE", "count": 2}]}, "postId": "urn:li:ugcPost:7520177214374641664", "pinned": false, "contributed": false, "edited": false, "actor": {"id": "ACoAAG13Ci0BCiPxP6apOHGr65mDQgZscCqUG2Q", "type": "profile", "name": "Sajjad Hasan", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/sajjadhasan-founder", "position": "Founder at OperantSolo | Practical n8n workflows & troubleshooting | API retries, duplicate prevention & human approval", "pictureUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQHQ9Y_BYs3UXw/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4DaBySG5GJoAI-/0/1788623745712?e=1795046400&v=beta&t=Oe6X3-jadEiUYq4QcSJKmonFn326JZo1wGTxN1iiLNg", "picture": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQHQ9Y_BYs3UXw/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4DaBySG5GJoAI-/0/1788623745712?e=1795046400&v=beta&t=Oe6X3-jadEiUYq4QcSJKmonFn326JZo1wGTxN1iiLNg", "width": 800, "height": 800}, "author": false}, "replies": [{"id": "7520529861124423680", "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7520177214374641664?commentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28ugcPost%3A7520177214374641664%2C7520456457641742336%29&replyUrn=urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28ugcPost%3A7520177214374641664%2C7520529861124423680%29&dashCommentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287520456457641742336%2Curn%3Ali%3AugcPost%3A7520177214374641664%29&dashReplyUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287520529861124423680%2Curn%3Ali%3AugcPost%3A7520177214374641664%29", "commentary": "Sajjad Hasan Great point, thank you! I'm confirming payments through the Paystack webhook, not the redirect. Signature check, amount match and the payment reference as the key will stop duplicate dispatches. Appreciate the tips.", "commentaryAttributes": [{"start": 0, "length": 12, "type": "PROFILE_MENTION", "hyperlink": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACoAAG13Ci0BCiPxP6apOHGr6